{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/isekai_fps_shooting.gif?t=1749539083\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enter the world of Arcadia, where a candy-colored, manga-inspired reality collides with the dark power of portals unleashed by the rising might of the Demon Lord</strong>. Step into the shoes of an ordinary FPS gamer, accidentally summoned to another world to save an adorable realm full of cute creatures\u2026 now twisted by the darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade your arsenal, fuse monstrous cores with your weapons, increase your rank, and battle increasingly powerful demons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/isekai_fps_anime_equip_weapon.gif?t=1749539083\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From waves of cute yet grotesque monsters and battles against the demon army's officers to a showdown with the Demon Lord himself\u2014get ready for fast-paced, anime-style action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Win the favor of the Goddesses (each with her own quirky personality), earn divine blessings, uncover the secrets of the celestial pantheon, and prove that even a regular gamer can become the savior of another world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553190/extras/isekai_fps_anime_manga_riskia.gif?t=1749539083\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> With humor, fast-paced FPS combat, and a touch of divine chaos\u2014this is an adventure you won\u2019t forget!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Right from the start, you receive a divine gift, <strong>a hero\u2019s special ability\u2026</strong> <strong>You can shop online!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://st